 begin="03:03.980" end="03:04.147">wa </span><span studio:id="ffef3418-e05d-45b3-a317-9b9803a1e6f2" begin="03:04.147" end="03:04.441">ya </span><span studio:id="37575471-268a-41ed-8117-928ebd2311b3" begin="03:04.441" end="03:04.786">ka </span><span studio:id="c85d1d02-cf32-407b-8d6d-971030ec76fb" begin="03:04.786" end="03:05.102">wo </span><span studio:id="8eca8db1-850a-48d0-ada0-5e13834a3f93" begin="03:05.102" end="03:05.382">i </span><span studio:id="4b4de4f5-7c7b-4f31-9ca1-1f144f1a00fe" begin="03:05.382" end="03:05.702">ki </span><span studio:id="789621b3-2bfe-4f2d-9b1f-196f8d683035" begin="03:05.702" end="03:05.856">yo </span><span studio:id="70df09e3-93ac-4075-ade1-e73d8b37fabc" begin="03:05.856" end="03:05.979">u</span></text><text for="line-4c945373-dd94-4c2c-bf3e-63aeada8cbcf" studio:id="f8d945f2-efd8-4d3d-bc15-0102c1bba630" studio:kind="timed"><span studio:id="9b813a0d-1e6a-414e-ab4b-069e0c258044" begin="03:05.979" end="03:06.202">shi </span><span studio:id="26f5a8fd-e968-4e86-8e21-71bb28534815" begin="03:06.202" end="03:06.442">n </span><span studio:id="bf51991b-539e-4cba-846b-55cbffa446fa" begin="03:06.442" end="03:06.674">ku </span><span studio:id="f7e9287d-0bf4-4dc5-88b7-1d06db4164ff" begin="03:06.674" end="03:06.962">no </span><span studio:id="1ab2711e-3477-4a7e-a40e-efd232c6a860" begin="03:06.962" end="03:07.195">ya </span><span studio:id="7414f533-291d-4b39-9f18-af4ad6b1aada" begin="03:07.195" end="03:07.273">i </span><span studio:id="63a44e47-53cb-42b2-8aad-958debfeb319" begin="03:07.273" end="03:07.941">ba</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation studio:id="7fde3b6e-48e6-42d8-96fd-dd16e23bdb62" type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="line-1b757ded-548c-4c03-a94c-73959a84b885" studio:id="9ef4716c-cd96-43ed-8047-ab4461632c37" studio:kind="plain">跨过尸骸前行吧</text><text for="line-a8567291-ede7-4315-a939-8479266ab69f" studio:id="baf57214-7a58-4614-867a-f7c88593af33" studio:kind="plain">这片化作焦土的大地</text><text for="line-3eca89ce-f92b-4b37-adc2-b21e86f94210" studio:id="2a2b2bca-fe5c-46ca-b3a5-f9f99e683d29" studio:kind="plain">被灰色的雨涂成黑色</text><text for="line-41a57498-3f95-40d6-87ae-11a979bd9e4c" studio:id="88b868d3-a7d5-40d0-8dd0-53cbb49e40ee" studio:kind="plain">并掩埋殆尽 Silence</text><text for="line-2a8c3b6e-8de5-45b4-8863-a623a282ff51" studio:id="74f51a06-dafb-4a07-88c1-6d253d79a48e" studio:kind="plain">高举各自的觉悟（武器）</text><text for="line-7d74939b-d3db-4975-a75a-6333aa7d3125" studio:id="c81b4102-51e6-4d5e-bf75-6a81e2828623" studio:kind="plain">结束战斗的同志们啊</text><text for="line-3c2a6701-03d7-44b4-ad30-e0c79b631843" studio:id="7f7c3551-8ecc-4108-9756-ea1334d27b0f" studio:kind="plain">直到重逢的那一天</text><text for="line-2a9a62e5-a2c8-46cb-9117-ed860309b653" studio:id="118fcee8-8c15-4746-b3bb-5d4012bd4c71" studio:kind="plain">恐惧与迷茫</text><text for="line-611100bf-1ad8-4cdb-a2e8-85a1217a28cf" studio:id="1f23860c-f48d-4fe1-8e07-5f1b2c083477" studio:kind="plain">几度重叠 无边无际般</text><text for="line-2abc0c00-e1f0-4df3-8aa2-b3547a429272" studio:id="2d1a2255-2a2d-4376-938a-cd52399e43eb" studio:kind="plain">化作高高耸立的障壁</text><text for="line-d71ea443-39da-44eb-9e52-c07d3ac9809e" studio:id="45ea46f2-4208-4774-81ac-1b316a8ac35f" studio:kind="plain">剑正呼唤着</text><text for="line-dda2ccf8-6115-4647-9a1d-a4dabe988a91" studio:id="a3cd77a0-de65-4837-a5b8-41761567afe1" studio:kind="plain">拳中的 my patience</text><text for="line-b99407f6-0318-4c2f-b8e9-091bc9ff068f" studio:id="24cd04d1-0f2e-4e27-a665-b7ae0bae1969" studio:kind="plain">在相遇与离别的轮回（往复）前方</text><text for="line-3675cad0-69bc-4595-bd51-d2acd810807f" studio:id="714eb004-ee9b-4a78-9e90-e990d6caa5e2" studio:kind="plain">若这即将燃尽的世界</text><text for="line-0b145d0b-0fd3-4bf4-a580-e9d090ca7532" studio:id="6ddaaf24-fc23-47d0-b525-037ca05bf112" studio:kind="plain">能够存续到第7日的话</text><text for="line-f5c0eacd-65b2-4d59-bb98-a1f9fb0fa54d" studio:id="0666f0d6-c515-41ca-9e28-98063b42daec" studio:kind="plain">那我便要活到第8天</text><text for="line-fb9de7a8-15d6-4121-b987-b594d2b3c27b" studio:id="9e0c2887-7e7f-4247-a6db-31543033b63a" studio:kind="plain">真红之刃</text><text for="line-faac08e5-ca7d-4377-a65d-175226db0468" studio:id="ad627ab6-9a5c-4b17-af9c-c2ecb07c9c1e" studio:kind="plain">即便同归于尽</text><text for="line-5462ab03-8710-4a9c-bfd8-254bf4536016" studio:id="820d2dd2-c001-409c-a15b-5ab83c3dd143" studio:kind="plain">也要在这胸中绽放荣光（花朵）</text><text for="line-f171d570-0b6c-4d6b-9880-6a1a4822f42e" studio:id="149f8999-9895-4140-ad63-1bd28c26eb56" studio:kind="plain">如果跨过那一天活下来的证明</text><text for="line-9ee8dfae-8fd4-4261-b283-afd0e13b5a97" studio:id="3cf4346e-9867-4705-a1bb-becd27009a0f" studio:kind="plain">能化作道路的话</text><text for="line-471a4b8b-462b-47f2-a136-512a969ef515" studio:id="7b2edb7d-1457-48a4-a74a-ebca2fb3717a" studio:kind="plain">至少让结局</text><text for="line-c73cd3cb-858b-4b91-9f4a-f845a22f1510" studio:id="4dd191ed-c278-47ee-b4f6-7943a156bf60" studio:kind="plain">在你的记忆里</text><text for="line-ab7631e4-44e1-48d7-bf05-564e61485361" studio:id="9142fa88-2467-4b13-bc37-6ef1d1242191" studio:kind="plain">是绚烂华美的模样</text><text for="line-89ba282d-5835-4dd6-8f99-82807bda76b4" studio:id="3a205206-4970-42c5-b322-b00863cc1383" studio:kind="plain">如此祈愿着</text><text for="line-2419d74f-78a2-4649-bf29-783921749b23" studio:id="e3f2acca-f2d9-4b39-8950-851af738cb65" studio:kind="plain">剑依然记得</text><text for="line-3414a794-c1df-4803-969b-b1b67cd02f9f" studio:id="f191fb25-985c-4ced-8b3c-92fb93bab641" studio:kind="plain">那快要消逝的 sacrifice</text><text for="line-c70b8541-8b7f-4a9f-940d-b4eca7746f63" studio:id="07f1e28c-f878-4cf7-836f-e48bee909b8a" studio:kind="plain">用颤抖的双脚将大地</text><text for="line-8e7b783d-b6ac-4b2b-b09b-f16a132ad2a4" studio:id="dedb75c7-c158-4953-9290-6c39f4e8d8e1" studio:kind="plain">牢牢踏实前行吧</text><text for="line-29fad35e-628b-45f6-b3b4-efd8a5d49532" studio:id="e813564e-e25e-48d2-aa90-d78b0166bcd0" studio:kind="plain">若谁都渴望的未来</text><text for="line-d7743fe7-b0cd-4065-84e1-48626c2e7ded" studio:id="92c381b4-0f01-420f-a512-93b72ef82727" studio:kind="plain">能够逃离到第7日的话</text><text for="line-5f83a3bb-d886-4f53-9499-11bb9cc17fe2" studio:id="08a0b77b-cc59-49c7-b3a5-977fc33ee96d" studio:kind="plain">那我便要奔跑到第8天</text><text for="line-c86a50b9-4fc8-4067-a9aa-52b34279794e" studio:id="bf31ddf0-937d-4d78-92e8-4fdb4eb9ec96" studio:kind="plain">真红之刃</text><text for="line-f147392c-dbf6-4069-a4a6-642692935850" studio:id="4743cb0e-e142-4bec-9a8c-4ad0adc9e6bf" studio:kind="plain">剑正呼唤着</text><text for="line-5af57fba-ebf0-4f8c-8be8-19048b662e31" studio:id="ff0180bb-6eec-4a58-b78b-e1c4b17ebfe3" studio:kind="plain">拳中的 my patience</text><text for="line-6ec67946-30c3-4869-a9bd-5be3ad21c1d4" studio:id="6dc3c459-b768-4d77-99d5-f3e0cc9ba3c0" studio:kind="plain">在相遇与离别的轮回（往复）前方</text><text for="line-9f1de6df-1f26-429d-85e5-161942d392b7" studio:id="46b84285-4138-4372-9fa8-ca7bdbb990e4" studio:kind="plain">若这即将燃尽的世界</text><text for="line-f143042a-2e9d-4ed0-adeb-d197487a5b96" studio:id="78d6eef3-d784-45d5-ba96-e22febc6620f" studio:kind="plain">能够存续到第7日的话</text><text for="line-47f6dc49-be4b-48b4-b431-ade52b82eaab" studio:id="53854ab8-696d-4f63-bc4d-5a80d4453891" studio:kind="plain">那我便要活到第8天</text><text for="line-4c945373-dd94-4c2c-bf3e-63aeada8cbcf" studio:id="4391634f-90e6-43b9-9e4f-e8f89a666eae" studio:kind="plain">真红之刃</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:07.941"><div><p xml:id="line-1b757ded-548c-4c03-a94c-73959a84b885" itunes:key="line-1b757ded-548c-4c03-a94c-73959a84b885" begin="00:01.136" end="00:03.856" ttm:agent="v1"><span studio:id="75cb1355-e3aa-4b5f-b179-6f5c171bc76c" begin="00:01.136" end="00:01.936" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">屍</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" studio:id="9a3003e0-3243-40cf-af41-5b784590ddb8" begin="00:01.136" end="00:01.336">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" studio:id="539d95dd-d65d-4792-bea9-a9a37df91e87" begin="00:01.336" end="00:01.496">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" studio:id="0a710f44-d421-4367-9dc1-4b7109588c1b" begin="00:01.49